            "created_at": "2025-10-01T04:22:06.049293+00:00",
            "notes": "If you had a disgustingly bad first few rounds, please ensure that if you can only afford one expensive item that it is [Orb of Perception](item_762bf2a4-c062-4dfd-b8e0-47e37ba1cadf). This item is absolutely fantastic, and is something you will keep for the rest of the build.\n\n[Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c) is the best thing for an aggressive zen. Be sure to get this power right after enlightenment as they pair amazingly and allow for great survivability. Makes zen a tank. Keep AP up to boost your self healing through [Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c)!\n\nKeep AP and WP as even as you can and continue playing aggressive.",
